## Known tech debt (do not worsen)

- 3 duplicate session caches: `AuthService`, `ApiExecutor`, `BaseRbacTest` → consolidate when touching auth
- `BaseTest` mixes static + instance state — risky with `parallel="classes"` in functional.xml
- Cleanup stubbed in `BaseTest.cleanupTestData()` — `CleanupService` exists but underused
- Credentials in `config/*.properties` — use env vars / CI secrets, never commit new secrets
- RBAC bypasses `ApiExecutor` (raw RestAssured) — prefer ApiExecutor for new code
- UI selectors use Tailwind classes + Ukrainian locale strings — prefer `data-testid` when adding pages

